            "quote": "<p>“I’ve worked with Treat House for years, and they have been nothing short of exceptional. Whether it’s a last-minute request for a few hundred treats or a large-scale order of thousands shipped nationwide, they always deliver with consistency and care. Their branding and quality are unmatched (logo’d treats are so hard to find!), with endless flavor options that never fail to impress. Most importantly, Jen and Chris are so accommodating, reliable, and truly committed to making it work every single time. They always meet you where you’re at and will try anything you need to make it happen—they’re simply the best. Working in the hospitality industry myself, I deeply value their dedication to their customers—it’s what makes them the best in the business.”</p>",
